m gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>　SPECIAL イベント　<br>　Coming Soon…！</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1703748734560" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1703748734560"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p><br></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667350759533" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667350759533" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1665548884330" data-id="1665548884330"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667350759583" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1667350759583"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">MIYASHITA PARK STORE限定で</span><br></h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">関連団体への寄付を実施</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667350759528" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1667350759528"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>「4th Anniversary Fair」に合わせて、</p><p>MIYASHITA PARK STOREでは</p><p>お買い上げいただいた商品に合わせて、</p><p>カポックの原産地であるインドネシアの</p><p>団体<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.2px;">への寄付を実施しています。</span></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667877277847" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667877277847" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667877277805" data-id="1667877277805"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667877314802" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1667877314802"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h3 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">【Donation outline】</h3></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667877403928" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1667877403928" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>＜期間＞</p><p>2024 1/2(Tue)〜1/20(Sat)</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667877460410" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1667877460410"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>お買い上げ金額のうち</p><p>「4th Anniversary Fair」にちなんで</p><p>「4％」を関連団体に寄付します。</p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1667877656216" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1667877656216" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>(*Fumi Nikaido × KAPOK KNOT　Plant Based Down2030は対象外です)</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1667877718817" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1667877718817" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1667876946443" data-id="1667876946443"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1669259439331" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1669259439331" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>＜寄付先＞　</p><p>寄付先は①〜③のうちより、</p><p>お客様のご投票にて決定させていただきます。</p><p><br></p><p>①インドネシアの生産者の労働支援</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">②カポックの植樹、栽培　　　</span></p><p>③インドネシアの動物保護団体への寄付</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1704358736089" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1704358736089" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1704358736062" data-id="1704358736062"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1704358865893" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1704358865893"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Information</h1><div><br></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1704358777024" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1704358777024"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>この度の令和6年能登半島地震により、</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">被害を受けられた皆様に、心よりお見舞い申し上げます。</span></p><p>現在も大変厳しい状況が続いておりますが、</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">一日も早くこころよい日常を取り戻せることを祈っております。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p>KAPOK JAPANは令和6年能登半島地震の復興支援として、</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">イベント期間中の売上金額から得た利益の一部を、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">被災地への支援として寄付させていただきます。</span></p><p>寄付先については、ネット募金サービス</p><p>「Yahoo!ネット募金」を予定しております。</p><p>また、この地震の影響により一部地域において</p><p>お荷物のお届けに遅れが生じる可能性がございます。</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">お客様にはご不便をおかけいたしますが、</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">何卒ご理解いただけますようお願い申し上げます。</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1704444739896" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1704444739896"><div class="elm gf-elm-center" data-align="left"><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Google Maps" data-key="google_maps" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1704444536555" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-googlemaps" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1704444536555" style=""><div class="module gf_google-map " data-title="" data-location="address" data-latitude="51.5256447" data-longitude="-0.0836529999" data-address="MIYASHITA PARK" data-height="400px" data-mapzoom-lg="15" data-mapzoom-md="13" data-mapzoom-sm="12" data-mapzoom-xs="15" data-views="map" data-mapdefault="0" data-maincolor="#2d313f" data-mapsaturation="-20" data-mapbrightness="5" data-customkey="0" data-api-key=""><div class="gf_google-container"><div class="gf_warning_container"><p class="gf_warning_title">You are in advanced mode.</p><p class="gf_warning_content">You can turn it off in left sidebar. To use advance